<title>HONG KONG: Jingwei '96 net rises 12.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Jingwei '96 net rises 12.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of yuan unless stated, against 1995 figures)</p>
<p>    Revs			 654.45    vs  717.19</p>
<p>    Net Profits		 78.86    vs   70.12</p>
<p>    Earnings per share    0.19 yuan  vs 0.32 yuan</p>
<p>Net assets per share  1.65 yuan  vs 1.45 yuan</p>
<p>Company name: Jingwei Textile Machinery Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Note: The results, published in an annual report in the Shenzhen-based Securities Times on Monday, were calculated under Chinese accounting standards.</p>
</text>
